    {
      "text": "The Gu Masters and mortals living in Hei Fan grotto-heaven are all descendants of Hei tribe’s criminal immortals. Fang Yuan kills all of them, planning to feed their collected souls to Dang Hun Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1133
