      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eleven Huang Jin tribes remain, and Hei tribe is one of the two that are no longer counted among them. Many Hei tribe Gu Immortals survive, but the tribe is annexed by Bai Zu tribe. Its tribe name is discarded, and it is no longer acknowledged by the other Huang Jin tribes, being cast aside and disdained.",
